<!doctype html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <style>
      body { font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", Times, serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.4; text-align: justify; color: #111; }
      h1 { font-size: 16pt; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 12pt; }
      .watermark {
        position: fixed;
        top: 45%;
        left: 50%;
        transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-30deg);
        font-size: 64pt;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        white-space: nowrap;
        pointer-events: none;
        z-index: -1;
      }
      .footer {
        position: fixed;
        bottom: 1cm;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 10pt;
        color: #333;
      }
      .section { margin-bottom: 10pt; }
      ol { padding-left: 1.3cm; }
      li { margin-bottom: 8pt; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="watermark">CONFIDENTIAL</div>
    <h1>PARTNERSHIP DEED</h1>

    <div class="section">
      This Partnership Deed ("Deed") is executed on {{start_date}} at {{city}} between:
      <br/><br/>
      <b>Partner 1:</b> {{partner_1_name}}, {{partner_1_address}}
      <br/>
      <b>Partner 2:</b> {{partner_2_name}}, {{partner_2_address}}
      <br/><br/>
      <b>Firm Name:</b> {{firm_name}}
      <br/>
      <b>Business Nature:</b> {{business_nature}}
      <br/><br/>
      <b>Capital Contribution:</b>
      <br/>Partner 1: {{capital_contribution_1}}
      <br/>Partner 2: {{capital_contribution_2}}
      <br/><br/>
      <b>Profit Ratio:</b> {{profit_ratio}}
    </div>

    <ol>
      <li>
        <b>Formation and Name.</b> The partners hereby agree to carry on business in partnership under the name of {{firm_name}}.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Nature of Business.</b> The firm shall engage in {{business_nature}} in accordance with applicable Indian laws.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Duration.</b> The partnership shall commence on {{start_date}} and continue unless dissolved as per the Deed.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Capital Contributions.</b> Partner 1 and Partner 2 shall contribute capital as mentioned above and may adjust capital by mutual consent.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Profit and Loss Sharing.</b> Profits and losses shall be shared in the ratio of {{profit_ratio}}.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Management and Duties.</b> The partners shall participate in management and ensure proper accounting, compliance, and governance of the firm.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Bank Account and Operations.</b> The firm shall maintain bank accounts in the name of the firm. Payments shall be authorized as agreed by the partners.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Accounting and Records.</b> Books of accounts shall be maintained and audited/verified as required under applicable law.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Withdrawal/Retirement.</b> Any partner may withdraw or retire only in accordance with the mutual terms and applicable legal provisions.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Dissolution.</b> The partnership may be dissolved by mutual consent or as permitted by law and this Deed.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Governing Law and Jurisdiction.</b> This Deed shall be governed by Indian law and disputes shall be subject to competent courts at {{city}}.
      </li>
    </ol>

    <div style="margin-top: 18pt;">
      <div style="display:flex; justify-content: space-between;">
        <div style="width: 45%;">
          <div><b>Partner 1</b></div>
          <div style="margin-top: 36pt;">Name: {{partner_1_name}}</div>
        </div>
        <div style="width: 45%;">
          <div><b>Partner 2</b></div>
          <div style="margin-top: 36pt;">Name: {{partner_2_name}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">This document is generated by NextGenLegal and is legally valid under Indian law</div>
  </body>
</html>

